    <div class="cn-tldr"><h2>In 30 seconds</h2><ul>
      <li>Stiff: can't get there, even with help. Unstable: gets there, but doesn't feel secure.</li>
      <li>Most shoulder pain is the rotator cuff being overloaded, and exercise is first-line care.</li>
      <li>A scan "tear" isn't always the cause. Plenty of pain-free shoulders have one.</li>
    </ul></div>
